From 6914c0beaf82030aace39352a5ae45115c9dea19 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gohy Yves <6154641+diogeneyves@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:18:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Gallery: make read-only without a password, check origin on
 every POST

Without a password ([Gallery] password empty), the gallery is read-only: pages and
files can still be seen and downloaded, the delete buttons, forms and selection boxes
are not shown, and any POST to /delete/<game>, /delete/<game>/<file> or /delete-many
is refused with a 403 page (gallery-error, gallery-back) without deleting anything.
With a password, behaviour is unchanged.

Every POST, /login included, is accepted only if its Origin header, or else its
Referer, has the host (and port) of its Host header; otherwise 403.

gallery-warning and gallery-no-password reworded in the 6 languages (keys unchanged),
.mo files recompiled with msgfmt.
